### Translate a plain text (synchronous, no job, no streaming)
POST http://localhost:8080/zia-trad/api/translation/plain-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Bonjour, comment allez-vous ?",
  "targetLanguage": "de"
}

### List the extraction profiles
GET http://localhost:8080/zia-trad/api/v1/extraction-profiles

### Keys of the sumex-invoice extraction profile
GET http://localhost:8080/zia-trad/api/v1/extraction-profiles/sumex-invoice

### Submit an extraction with a profile (vision model, structured output, async)
POST http://localhost:8080/zia-trad/api/v1/extractions
Idempotency-Key: D_0035-3f2a9c1be04d7a61
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invoice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./invoice.pdf
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="context"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profile": "sumex-invoice",
  "documentId": "D_0035",
  "language": "de",
  "knownFields": {"patient.ssn": "7568250251199"},
  "missingFields": ["biller.gln", "treatment.date_begin", "balance.amount", "services"]
}
--boundary--

> {% client.global.set("extractionJobId", response.body.jobId); %}

### Submit an ad hoc extraction (no profile: free keys extracted as text)
POST http://localhost:8080/zia-trad/api/v1/extractions
Idempotency-Key: contract-42
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="scan.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./scan.png
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="context"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "contract-42",
  "missingFields": ["contract.number", "customer.name", "signature.date"],
  "instructions": "The customer is the person who signs at the bottom of the last page."
}
--boundary--

### Poll the extraction job
GET http://localhost:8080/zia-trad/api/v1/extractions/{{extractionJobId}}
